    <span class="eyebrow">about</span>
    <h1 style="max-width: 16ch;">Built by someone who was tired of managing four vendors<span class="hero__cursor"></span></h1>
    <p class="hero__sub">Zemprolabs exists because the standard model — a dev shop, an SEO agency, a marketing team, and no one for the ongoing small stuff — doesn't actually work for most businesses.</p>
  </div>
